    "ANTs warps are reoriented from their own NIfTI index frame to the cohort grid; the mapping is fixed only up to a per-axis REVERSAL, so an ants_<brain>_z<k> row may correspond to the cohort's z = 527 - k. A reversal negates the axis and its displacement component together, so every Jacobian sign (and hence every metric here) is invariant; do NOT pair cohort_* and ants_* rows by z.",
